VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'a YouTube video. And now, let\'s imagine I wanted to go grocery shopping. How good can I control the upload and continue the upload via just my phone? So, I create a new chat and just say,'

[06:56] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: '"Check the status of my YouTube upload." It\'s currently analyzing my screen, automatically switching to the upload tab in Google Chrome, but it will work in Safari as well. So, it says, "Upload'

[07:08] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'processing is finished." And now, he wants to click the continue button to actually continue uploading the video. Let\'s just try if this actually works. But, I would like him to improve the video tags'

[07:22] [scene:talk]
