AUDIO: 'four minutes, but the tags are inserted. It also automatically removed the old tags, which were there just as a default, &gt;&gt; [music] &gt;&gt; and clicked on continue now. So, I\'m excited that it actually works. And'

[08:14] [scene:talk]
