AUDIO: 'tokens if you use it all day long. The good thing is you can set a daily limit, a daily cap. But, [music] once you reach it, Vialume basically isn\'t usable for the rest of the day. So, you probably have'

[11:34] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'to set it to something around like $15 to $25 a day. And this can add up for personal use. But if you\'re a freelancer, or you use it for business, or you work even pays for it,'

[11:47] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'then it can be insanely helpful. It can do the repetitive tasks that you do every day or every week for you and save you so much time. A research where users of the ViLoop have been'

[12:01] [scene:talk]
